# Design system

- Before changing Pages, PWA, or ceremony UI, read `DESIGN.md` and `docs/design/controls.md`.
- An action that executes is an icon key (`icon-btn`, or `.go` when it ends the screen). `aria-label` and `title` carry the sentence. Do not put a verb on the button face.
- A status is a `StatusMark` glyph (check, alert, dismiss, lock) with `aria-label` and `title`. Do not paint Connected, Needs you, Broken, or any other status word on a pill.
- Text on a control is only a choice object or a name: a provider, a mode, a navigation target, the guest road, a role, a person.
- Do not add explainer captions. A panel head is a title. Show the account, grant, or repository.
- `pnpm lint:design` and impeccable detect enforce this in `.githooks/pre-commit`. Do not add a word-verb button to get past them, and do not raise `tools/quality/design-button-baseline.json`.
